    "created_at": "2020-04-17T09:24:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-17T09:24:06Z",
    "body": "It would need to be done without relying on colour alone, and at the sentence level that's likely to be tricky without making things less usable for some.\r\n\r\nIt would be a huge undertaking, but splitting the content into more definite chunks for the respective audiences would make it very clear. Taking this idea further, the content could be contained in disclosures (one for each audience), perhaps with the ability for people to choose which set of disclosures were open by default when they read the spec.",
