    "created_at": "2020-04-17T10:46:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-17T10:46:25Z",
    "body": "Some parts of the spec have entire sections for different conformance classes, e.g. [The HTML syntax](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax). Others have a section split up between authoring and user agent requirements, e.g. [the `meter` element](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-meter-element). This separation seems good but might not work well everywhere, like when there are many small features (like the `sizes` attribute on `link`).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
